[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0002","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0002.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"某主流操作系统内核网络模块栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CNNVD-2026-10099003 为某主流操作系统内核网络模块中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对用户态传入的数据长度进行有效校验，攻击者可通过构造特制网络请求包触发栈缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响多个版本的操作系统及衍生发行版，攻击复杂度低且无需用户交互，CVSS 评分高达 9.8，危害等级为严重。目前厂商已发布安全更新修复该漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10099003"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-05","updated":"2026-07-05","remediation":"建议用户立即将操作系统内核升级至厂商发布的最新稳定版本，包含针对该漏洞的安全补丁。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可采取临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙配置访问控制策略，限制对受影响网络服务的非授权访问；启用内核栈保护机制（如Stack Canary、ASLR）；在支持的应用场景下使用eBPF或内核模块动态拦截异常网络请求包。请关注厂商官方安全公告获取详细补丁编号及升级指引。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T07:55:39.478603296+00:00","references":["https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/home/vulnerability/detail/CNNVD-2026-10099003"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0094","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53359","title":"Linux Linux Kernel KVM 虚拟机逃逸漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 KVM 虚拟化子系统的 x86 影子分页机制存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，漏洞源于角色（role）字段校验缺失导致非叶子页表被错误复用。攻击者可通过在虚拟机外部修改 PDE 映射后删除内存槽（memslot）触发该漏洞，造成影子页释放后 rmap 条目仍残留，后续脏页记录或 MMU 通知器遍历该 GFN 时将解引用已释放内存导致内核崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 KVM 相关版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53359"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-04T12:17:01.760","updated":"2026-07-18T08:16:36.620","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：主线 ≥ 7.2-rc1，或长期支持分支升级至 6.1.177+、6.6.144+、6.12.95+、6.18.38+、7.1.3+。内核修复提交包括 1ae7d5a6db6c、2ad3afa40ac6、5e470998a23e4、81ccda30b4e8、9291654d69e0、b1337aae5e19（均在 arch/x86/kvm/mmu/mmu.c 中修复影子页表角色校验缺失导致的 use-after-free）。若无法立即更新，可临时限制 /dev/kvm 设备文件的访问权限（仅允许受信用户），或卸载 kvm_amd/kvm_intel 内核模块停止虚拟机服务作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1ae7d5a6db6c190ce183e3098ca0e0846e14d462","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ad3afa40ac6aa340dada122f9abfa46c0a6eb35","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5e470998a23e4c3d89ed24e8172cb22747e61efa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/81ccda30b4e83d8f5cc4fd50503c44e3a33abfeb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9291654d69e08542de37755cebe4d5b02c3170d1","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b1337aae5e194324e4810d561764e7793f8b3864","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/07/06/7","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-53359.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-53359.json","https://github.com/yandex-cloud/docs/blob/f2deb42e097c742df149ae3be26d835122873712/ru/_includes/security/security-bulletins/CVE-2026-53359-januscape.md","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/ARGOeu-Metrics/secmon-probes/blob/39c7b00a6c5ee3198df75d8d1d85ccdfdb0f728e/src/WN-probes/check_CVE-2026-53359","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-53359-2026-07-06-1805","https://github.com/Unclecheng-li/poc-lab/blob/b3a8fa7275a8368823f63eba88eb6e6b8e62a718/CVE-2026-53359%20Januscape/exploit/BUILD.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/7ddd42377be9a6b7218518cc45c52da044b527c3/2026/CVE-2026-53359.json","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-53359/KVM-XJ.c","https://github.com/QVMConsole/QVMConsole/blob/ab919948bd90c04a4cc8bc0173e0b3b07ae450df/security/cve-2026-53359/restore.sh","https://github.com/Aoripus-LTD/Januscape-Hotfix","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-53359","https://github.com/chuzhongyun/CVE-2026-53359-Kernel-Fix","https://github.com/xj2268-TA/KVM-Januscape","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-53359","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-53359"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0094.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0094.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0007","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0007.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"CNNVD 暂未公开详情的未知厂商安全漏洞","description":"CNNVD-2026-10507485 为中国国家信息安全漏洞库收录的2026年安全漏洞，目前该漏洞详情尚未公开发布。CNNVD 已收录该漏洞编号，但具体受影响厂商、产品类型、攻击向量及影响范围等信息需等待 CNNVD 官方进一步披露。建议持续关注 CNNVD 官网更新。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CNNVD-2026-10507485"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-04","updated":"2026-07-04","remediation":"建议持续关注 CNNVD 官网该漏洞详情页面，待详细信息发布后，依据官方公告中的修复方案及时更新对应软件版本或应用补丁。同时加强网络安全监测，及时发现可疑攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cnnvd.org.cn/home/loophole/detail?id=CNNVD-2026-10507485"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0300","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27771","title":"Gitea Composer 包源链接权限检查不足漏洞","description":"Gitea 是一款自托管的 Git 服务，其 Composer 包源链接存在权限检查不足的漏洞（CWE-862 缺失授权）。已认证的攻击者可利用此缺陷，通过构造特定请求访问本应受限的私有或内部包源链接，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.1 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级至 1.26.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27771","GHSA-8qw8-rq86-9pc2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59.043","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:37.980","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.2 或更高版本（最新稳定版 v1.27.0），该版本已修复 Composer 包源链接的权限检查缺失问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层限制对 /api/packages/*/composer 路径的访问，仅允许授权用户访问，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.2/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/37610","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.2","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-8qw8-rq86-9pc2","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/portbuster1337/CVE-2026-27771","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c2df87babf8eed88f612cb73e25ef1a25c924358/2026/CVE-2026-27771.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2026/06/Gitea-CVE-2026-27771-%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87/Gitea-CVE-2026-27771-%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.05/CVE-2026-27771%EF%BC%9AGitea%20%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-27771.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27771.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/c911d60f6d680a69991ad0dd5e13c4da403965fe/plugins/gitea/gitea/CVE-2026-27771.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-27771.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27771.yml","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/9cd45c8ff86fc94d27c6255a665548fbf0c1c23f/2026/CVE-2026-27771/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/CVE-2026-27771"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0300.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0258","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0258.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-28740","title":"Gitea Git LFS 对象重用授权绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 在 Git LFS 对象复用功能中存在授权绕过漏洞（CWE-639）。由于源代码对象授权检查仅依赖仓库级别的访问权限，而未要求对拥有 LFS 对象的源仓库具有 Code 单元访问权限，导致拥有一个仓库 Code 写入权限的攻击者可将私有源仓库中的 Git LFS 对象关联到目标仓库，从而越权访问本无权限的私有源代码对象。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。建议升级至 1.26.3 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-28740","GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59.890","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:38.327","remediation":"修复说明：Gitea ≤1.26.2 中跨仓库 LFS 对象复用时仅检查仓库级别的访问权限而未验证 Code 单元权限，导致无 Code 访问权限的用户可借用 LFS 对象获取私有源仓库内容。官方在 v1.26.3 中通过 PR #38050 修复，但 v1.26.3 存在页面加载回归问题，请直接升级到 v1.26.4（2026-06-21 发布）；从 https://dl.gitea.com/gitea/1.26.4/ 下载对应平台的二进制替换后重启服务。如无法立即升级，可在仓库设置中移除非必要用户的仓库访问权限，并严格审查所有对私有仓库有读取权限的用户的 Code 单元授权。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38050","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28740.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/gitea.dev/CVE-2026-28740.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2167857fddab84dfe24129edd6c6319301254e21/2026/28xxx/CVE-2026-28740.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-28740.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/0d037049524b95a60ac45ee73f1d3c40caf9c2d9/posts/cve-2026-28740-go-gitea-dev.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq/GHSA-2m9v-5q2g-58vq.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-28740.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0258.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0255","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0255.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27775","title":"Gitea 预接收钩子权限缓存检查绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 1.25.5 版本在预接收钩子（pre-receive hook）会话中存在权限缓存缺陷，其对单分支的写入权限检查结果会错误地在同一会话中的多个引用（refs）间复用。拥有某分支维护者编辑权限的用户可借此跨分支提权，从而获得对完整存储库的写入访问权限。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，影响所有使用分支级权限功能且版本低于 1.25.6 的 Gitea 实例。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27775","GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:59.157","updated":"2026-07-06T18:17:26.860","remediation":"立即升级至 Gitea 1.26.3 或更高版本（最新为 1.26.4），该版本通过修复预接收挂钩（pre-receive hook）中分支级写入权限的缓存逻辑，阻止跨 ref 复用权限从而提权至完整仓库写入。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用预接收挂钩或对敏感仓库限制可写入分支的用户范围为最小必要权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7","https://github.com/Lazarus-AI/clearwing/blob/e8ca31740f4189d1cf18eee9155db840f4cb2f7b/evaluations/cve-2026-27775.sh","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27775.json","https://github.com/patrickmgarrity/Anthropic-Credited-CVEs/blob/197a0f190193760dbcf80800bcce685aa017dec5/cves/CVE-2026-27775.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27775.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27775.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27775.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27775.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/34612da2888772c9dd8862e0da8f78db038b1965/cve/CVE-2026-27775.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7/GHSA-649p-mmhf-85c7.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27775.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0255.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0255.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0255.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0254","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-27761","title":"Gitea 仓库 RSS/Atom Feed 接口访问令牌作用域绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 个人访问令牌（PAT）在仓库 RSS/Atom Feed 端点存在权限范围绕过漏洞。当用户使用受限作用域（如 `read:issue`）的令牌访问 RSS/Atom Feed 接口时，可以读取该用户有权访问的任意私有仓库的提交记录，包括提交 SHA、完整提交信息（可能包含密钥等敏感内容）以及提交者姓名和邮箱。而在 `/raw`、`/media`、`/archive` 及内容 API 等端点，相同令牌会被正确拒绝（403）。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。攻击者只需持有任意受限作用域的有效令牌即可利用，无需特殊权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-27761","GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:58.937","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:37.887","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.3 或更高版本（官方强烈建议直接升级至 v1.26.4），该版本在 RSS/Atom feed 端点强制实施了 API 令牌作用域检查。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 RSS/Atom feed 功能，或在反向代理层对 `/api/v1/repos/*/feed` 路径添加访问控制，仅允许拥有 repository 作用域的令牌访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38147","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/27xxx/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-27761.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj/GHSA-3pww-vcvm-3gmj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-27761.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-27761.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2026/FreeBSD-2026-0293.md","https://github.com/peleduri/zero-day-pulse/blob/d56f83f6d1e3899004c32c7c15cdd38e9dd954ba/docs/index.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0254.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0254.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0254.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0251","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25038","title":"Gitea Gitea 私人组织标签未授权访问漏洞","description":"Gitea 1.26.2 版本中存在组织标签访问控制缺陷漏洞，由于未正确对私有组织的标签读取端点实施可见性限制，导致未经授权的用户可通过 Organization Labels API 获取私有组织的标签元数据，造成敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需认证即可利用此漏洞获取本应仅限组织成员访问的标签信息，但无法对标签进行修改操作。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25038","GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57.503","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:36.270","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（官方强烈建议跳过 v1.26.3 直接升级到 v1.26.4，因 v1.26.3 存在仓库代码页加载回归问题）。该漏洞已在 PR #38151 中修复，升级后系统会在组织标签读取端点强制校验组织可见性，非成员用户无法再通过 Organization Labels API 获取私有组织标签数据。如无法立即升级，可暂时移除非成员对 Organization Labels API 的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-25038.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25038.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25038.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-25038.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-25038.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-25038.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4/GHSA-v73x-hx65-6pf4.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-25038.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2026/FreeBSD-2026-0293.md","https://github.com/peleduri/zero-day-pulse/blob/d56f83f6d1e3899004c32c7c15cdd38e9dd954ba/reports/latest.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0250","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0250.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24451","title":"Gitea 仓库分叉同步信息泄露漏洞","description":"Gitea 存在信息泄露漏洞。当上游仓库从公开仓库变更为私有仓库后，之前创建的 fork 仓库通过 `POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-upstream` 接口仍能继续同步上游仓库在私有期间提交的代码，导致本应受限的私有数据通过 fork 仓库泄露给未经授权的用户。攻击者只需在仓库公开时创建 fork，待其变为私有后执行同步操作即可获取私有代码。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24451","GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57.280","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35.970","remediation":"建议立即将 Gitea 升级至 v1.26.4 或更高版本（v1.26.3 已包含修复，但官方强烈建议直接升级到 v1.26.4），升级后在父仓库改为私有时会自动阻断 fork 的 merge-upstream 同步请求。如无法立即升级，可临时在反向代理层屏蔽 POST /api/v1/repos/{owner}/{repo}/merge-upstream 接口，或手动检查并删除不应继续拥有访问权限的 fork 仓库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-24451.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v/GHSA-wrf9-r3h7-7x5v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-24451.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-24451.json","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2026/FreeBSD-2026-0293.md","https://github.com/peleduri/zero-day-pulse/blob/d56f83f6d1e3899004c32c7c15cdd38e9dd954ba/docs/index.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0250.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0250.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0250.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0248","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-22874","title":"Gitea Webhook和迁移允许列表SSRF防护不完整漏洞","description":"Gitea 在 Webhook 投递和仓库迁移功能中使用了不完整的 SSRF 防护机制，其默认允许列表依赖 Go 标准库 `net.IP.IsPrivate()` 进行内网地址过滤，但该函数仅覆盖 RFC 1918 和 RFC 4193 定义的私有地址段，遗漏了云元数据服务、内部网络及 IPv6 过渡机制中使用的多个 IP 范围。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造指向这些未过滤地址段的请求，绕过 SSRF 防护，访问云服务元数据接口或内部系统，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.26.2 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.6，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-22874","GHSA-2r5c-gw76-rh3w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:57.157","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35.747","remediation":"立即将 Gitea 升级至 1.26.4 或更高版本（官方强烈建议跳过 1.26.3 直接升级至 1.26.4）。升级后系统将收紧 Webhook 和仓库迁移的默认 SSRF 允许列表，补齐 `net.IP.IsPrivate()` 未涵盖的云元数据 IP 段及 IPv6 过渡地址范围。如无法立即升级，可在 `app.ini` 中手工配置 `[webhook]` 和 `[migration]` 下的 `ALLOWED_HOST_LIST` 选项，限制仅允许访问预期的外部地址，并阻断 169.254.169.0/24、100.64.0.0/10 等内部保留段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38059","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38173","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-2r5c-gw76-rh3w","https://github.com/Eliot-code/CVE-2026-22874-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2026/CVE-2026-22874.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-22874.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22874.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-22874.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_3_CVE-2026-22874.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/9cd45c8ff86fc94d27c6255a665548fbf0c1c23f/2026/CVE-2026-22874/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-22874.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6f4731f51e94154e3d2f88d907f7808a8b98f9a9/cve/CVE-2026-22874.html","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22874.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/96dab026b1d19f98191e031637542a72caf337dc/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-22874/README.md","https://github.com/M8seven/cve-2026-22874-gitea-ssrf-allowlist"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0248.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0248.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0248.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0247","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0247.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20896","title":"Gitea Docker 镜像反向代理信任代理配置不当漏洞","description":"Gitea Docker 镜像默认配置中将 `REVERSE_PROXY_TRUSTED_PROXIES` 设置为 `*`，即信任所有来源 IP 的反向代理标头。当管理员启用 `ENABLE_REVERSE_PROXY_AUTHENTICATION` 后，任意远程攻击者无需认证即可通过构造特制的 `X-WEBAUTH-USER` 等 HTTP 标头，冒充任意用户身份访问 Gitea 实例。该漏洞影响 Gitea Docker 镜像 1.26.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者只需发送携带伪造标头的 HTTP 请求即可完成利用，无需任何权限。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20896","GHSA-f75j-4cw6-rmx4"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:56.660","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35.380","remediation":"立即升级 Gitea Docker 镜像至 1.26.4 或更高版本（1.26.3 因存在仓库代码页加载回归问题不建议使用）。如无法立即升级，在 Docker 的 app.ini 中将 `REVERSE_PROXY_TRUSTED_PROXIES` 从 `*` 改为实际反向代理 IP 段（如 `127.0.0.0/8,::1/128`），并确认 `ENABLE_REVERSE_PROXY_AUTHENTICATION` 仅在需要时手动开启。如无法修改配置，在防火墙/安全组层面限制 Gitea 实例仅允许信任的反向代理 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-f75j-4cw6-rmx4","https://github.com/rz1027/CVE-2026-20896","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2026/CVE-2026-20896.json","https://github.com/rxerium/rxerium-templates/blob/9027e3321654e19a5cae31a7fc9917246eccd3fb/2026/CVE-2026-20896.yaml","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0e170467e8e76cab69d827be2a520352df55825c/doc/2026-07/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-20896%20%E6%8A%AB%E9%9C%B2%E4%BB%85%2013%20%E5%A4%A9%EF%BC%8C%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E8%80%85%E5%B7%B2%E9%92%88%E5%AF%B9%20Gitea%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%BC%80%E5%B1%95%E6%8E%A2%E6%B5%8B%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20896.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-20896.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/9cd45c8ff86fc94d27c6255a665548fbf0c1c23f/2026/CVE-2026-20896/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-20896.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/326d1eb3c211c5432d4f6357a04093f6484ab9cc/archive/2026/2026-07-07.md","https://github.com/szybnev/cve-2026-20896-gitea-poc","https://github.com/XaocZenon/CVE-2026-20896","https://github.com/kaleth4/CVE-2026-20896"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0247.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0247.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0247.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0246","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0246.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20779","title":"Gitea TOTP 一次性验证绕过漏洞","description":"Gitea 双因素认证中存在 TOTP 单次使用校验缺陷，包括 Web 2FA 路径的 TOCTOU 竞争条件漏洞和 Basic-Auth 的 `X-Gitea-OTP` 头缺少重放校验两个问题。攻击者可在短时间窗口内并行提交请求，利用竞争条件或直接重放同一有效的 TOTP 验证码绕过单次使用限制，在未授权情况下完成登录。该漏洞影响 Gitea 1.5.0 至 1.26.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，建议升级至 1.26.3 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20779","GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T21:16:56.543","updated":"2026-07-07T18:16:35.270","remediation":"升级 Gitea 至 1.26.3 或更高版本，该版本修复了 TOTP 一次性验证缺陷。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层对 2FA 登录路径（/user/login/two_factor）添加速率限制，并禁用 Basic Auth 的 X-Gitea-OTP 头传递作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-1.26.3-and-1.26.4/","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/38151","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v1.26.3","https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-07-03/TIER_2_CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/go/code.gitea.io/gitea/CVE-2026-20779.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/6f4731f51e94154e3d2f88d907f7808a8b98f9a9/cve/CVE-2026-20779.html","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-20779.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-20779.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323/GHSA-gx3v-q759-g323.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0246.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0246.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0246.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0244","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0244.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14631","title":"Webpack webpack-dev-server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"webpack-dev-server 存在输入验证不当漏洞，未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标开发服务器发送包含格式错误 Host 标头的 HTTP 请求，或向默认 /ws 端点发送格式错误 Origin 标头的 WebSocket 升级请求，触发主机验证路径中的未捕获异常，导致 Node.js 进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 webpack-dev-server 5.2.5 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。建议升级至 5.2.6 版本修复，或将开发服务器绑定至 localhost 避免暴露于不可信网络。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14631","GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T18:16:24.687","updated":"2026-07-07T15:08:59.667","remediation":"立即将 webpack-dev-server 升级至 5.2.6 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，确保 dev server 仅监听 localhost（默认配置），切勿将其暴露到不可信网络中；可在反向代理或防火墙层面过滤含有异常 Host/Origin 标头的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/security/advisories/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/webpack-dev-server/CVE-2026-14631.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-14631.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-14631.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj/GHSA-m28w-2pqf-7qgj.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-14631.json","https://github.com/ericverret35/opsintel/blob/066e339688f1d946a07b54d213a43449e5764ac8/advisories/2026-07-20-ghsa-m28w-2pqf-7qgj.md","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/19a832a5a11c7c41b17a2495ce81341974b961f4/rss/openjs.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0244.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0243","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0243.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-14620","title":"Webpack webpack-dev-server 跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"webpack-dev-server 5.2.5 及之前版本中存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。其内部开发端点 `/webpack-dev-server/open-editor` 和 `/webpack-dev-server/invalidate` 在处理 GET 请求时未验证请求来源，导致开发者在启动 dev server 后访问任意恶意网站时，该网站可跨域触发上述端点。攻击者可利用此漏洞在开发者编辑器中打开任意本地文件（包括项目根目录外的文件），并通过重复请求不断生成编辑器进程、强制触发重编译，从而消耗系统资源影响开发环境正常运行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危，建议升级至 webpack-dev-server 5.2.6 及以上版本修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-14620","GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-03T17:16:53.620","updated":"2026-07-07T15:12:43.947","remediation":"立即将 webpack-dev-server 升级至 5.2.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复内部端点未经验证的跨域请求问题。如无法升级，可在反向代理层屏蔽 `/webpack-dev-server/open-editor` 和 `/webpack-dev-server/invalidate` 路径的 GET 请求，并将 dev server 的 `--host` 绑定为 `127.0.0.1` 避免外部网络访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/webpack/webpack-dev-server/security/advisories/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/webpack-dev-server/CVE-2026-14620.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/14xxx/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-14620.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-14620.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93/GHSA-f5vj-f2hx-8m93.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-14620.json","https://github.com/Pig-Tail/security-research/blob/44468c09a73aabaafaeb4eab9b4e1d82d664d93d/README.md","https://github.com/slowslowgogo/SecurityReport/blob/91e0ad564eb640912bc932d6e24eba40983b0eb3/output/brief_2026-07-04.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0243.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0096","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54477","title":"Gardyn IoT Hub 管理面板安全标头缺失漏洞","description":"Gardyn IoT Hub 管理面板未设置标准 HTTP 安全响应头（如 X-Frame-Options、Content-Security-Policy、X-Content-Type-Options 等），攻击者可通过构造恶意页面嵌入管理面板框架实施点击劫持攻击，或结合其他攻击向量触发跨站脚本攻击。该漏洞影响 Gardyn IoT Hub 设备的内置管理面板，虽然需要管理员用户交互方可利用，但攻击者可能借此窃取管理员会话凭据或在授权上下文中执行非预期操作，对设备机密性和完整性构成中等风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54477"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-03T00:16:52.440","updated":"2026-07-06T19:42:49.287","remediation":"确认 Gardyn IoT Hub 设备已联网，固件将自动更新至 master.627 及以上版本；Cloud API 已升级至 2.12.2026 及以上版本。在 Web 服务器或反向代理层为管理面板添加 Content-Security-Policy、X-Frame-Options: DENY、X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff 和 Strict-Transport-Security 等安全响应头，防止点击劫持和跨站脚本攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-183-03.json","https://mygardyn.com/security/","https://ww